  speakerName: APO LAKAY
  speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
  dialogueText: '"After enjoying the view, you''ll need to return to the ground.

    In
    Ilokano, ''bumaba'' means ''go down.''

    Use it when telling someone to move
    toward a lower place.

    Listen carefully: bumaba.

    Now, try saying ''bumaba''
    yourself."

'
